Package: qore-ssh2-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-ssh2-module-doc
Description: SSH, SFTP, polling and file providers for Qore
 This package provides native libssh2 bindings and source/compiled SFTP
 providers, polling utilities and connection types. It includes compiler
 metadata, provider resources and translations. It supports remote command
 execution, file transfers, host-key verification and asynchronous SFTP.

Package: qore-ssh2-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-ssh2-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's SSH2 modules
 This package contains HTML API references and example tests for the native
 SSH2 module, SFTP data provider, polling utilities and connection types.
